 Pacific Fisheries v. Territory of Alaska\">249 U. S. 53, 60-61</a></span>. <em>Mr. Elijah N. Zoline </em>and <em>Mr. John J. Fitzgerald </em>for plaintiffs in error. <em>The Solicitor General </em>for the United States.</p>\n</opinion>"}],"citations":[]}